  "correction": "Removed 1e-8 floors from log(d_std) and subsidiary-fraction log prior. A regression test fails on the old code (0.0 rather than -2*log(10)) and passes on the corrected code. Short-run FSL agreement remains similar; the corrected long run approaches near-zero values reached by long FSL sampling.",
